{"id":"da4a5dccfe412249","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-power-object.md","title":"thm-power-object-characterization","display":"thm-power-object-characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-power-object","aliases":["16-thm-power-object","16-thm--power-object"],"display":"thm-power-object-characterization","depends_on":["[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[16-df-power-object]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-ccc-definition]]"],"source":"Theorem 5.5.1 pp.346–347 (PDF366–367)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","proof_review_boundary":"Forward construction and uniqueness checked; reverse exponent construction is referred by Jacobs to [188, IV,2] and has not been independently reconstructed in this note."},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-power-object"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-power-object</span><span>16-thm--power-object</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-power-object-characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f1736212b369c916\" href=\"?note=f1736212b369c916\" title=\"16-df-power-object\">16-df-power-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem 5.5.1 pp.346–347 (PDF366–367)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_review_boundary","html":"Forward construction and uniqueness checked; reverse exponent construction is referred by Jacobs to [188, IV,2] and has not been independently reconstructed in this note."}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为范畴。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowObjAll}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowObjAll}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f1736212b369c916\" href=\"?note=f1736212b369c916\" title=\"16-df-power-object\">16-df-power-object</a>。</li>\n<li>有限积、子对象分类子和指数分别按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a> 的泛性质理解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{PowObjAll}(\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{PowObjAll}(\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从左到右：选定真值单态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top:1\\rightarrowtail\\Omega\">\\(\\top:1\\rightarrowtail\\Omega\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\Omega^I\">\\(P=\\Omega^I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 沿评价 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}:\\Omega^I\\times I\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}:\\Omega^I\\times I\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 的拉回。对关系单态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:R\\rightarrowtail J\\times I\">\\(m:R\\rightarrowtail J\\times I\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_m:J\\times I\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\chi_m:J\\times I\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为其唯一特征箭头，并取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=\\Lambda\\chi_m\">\\(r=\\Lambda\\chi_m\\)</span>。指数的 β 方程给出外矩形为拉回；拉回粘贴给出幂对象所需方块。任一关系分类箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&#39;\">\\(r&#39;\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}(r&#39;\\times\\operatorname{id}_I)=\\chi_m\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}(r&#39;\\times\\operatorname{id}_I)=\\chi_m\\)</span>，由分类子唯一性及指数 η 唯一性得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&#39;=r\">\\(r&#39;=r\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>反向为原书 Theorem 5.5.1 的对应结论：终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的泛成员关系经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P1\\times1\\cong P1\">\\(P1\\times1\\cong P1\\)</span> 给出子对象分类子，指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J^I\">\\(J^I\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(I\\times J)\">\\(P(I\\times J)\\)</span> 内全定义、单值关系构造。原书把该指数构造的完整细节转引至 [188, IV,2]；本页精确核对了原书陈述并闭合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowObjAll}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowObjAll}\\)</span> 的定义接口，但未在此独立重建反向构造。该证据边界随本文保留，不把来源陈述核对冒称为两向独立证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-power-object","status":"resolved","id":"f1736212b369c916","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-power-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴。$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]，$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathrm{PowObjAll}$ 采用 [[16-df-power-object]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fin